---
source: crates/dovetail-tui/tests/discoverability.rs
expression: "popup_text(&CONVERSATION, \"<leader>s\")"
---
[Agents] s    switch agent
[Agents] n    start a slice (name, then brief)
[Agents] q    ask a side question
[Agents] x    interrupt the agent's turn
[Agents] m    cycle permission mode: auto, acceptEdits, manual
[Agents] t    take the session over in this terminal
